44
00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:40.039
Keith Jansa: There, as part of that workshop, it became quite clear, that there is a shared belief between…

45
00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.760
Keith Jansa: the European jurisdiction and with Canada that

46
00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:57.399
Keith Jansa: We are both striving toward common outcomes, whether it's around user centricity, privacy-preserving technologies, secure access, recognizing that

47
00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:13.219
