Keith Jansa: And managed, and ultimately with a lens to, determine whether or not there's feasibility in having interoperable approaches between the jurisdictions.

52
00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:05.879
Keith Jansa: With respect to the issuing of, digital identities and trust service, digital identities, and verification, and, and so on and so forth.

53
00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.359
Keith Jansa: The study,

54
00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:26.609
Keith Jansa: found, with my colleague in the EU, Alice Jonathan, that there was no insurmountable legal, technical, or conceptual barriers to interoperability. The study found that there was alignment, it did an analysis with respect to the

55
