56
00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:37.169
Keith Jansa: And with respect to the, I believe, 27 articles in that model law.

57
00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:50.150
Keith Jansa: When looked in contrast with the European approach to governing digital, trust services and, in looking at Canada's.

